# What must never be uploaded to the build.
#
# Environment values belong in the Vercel dashboard, not in the deployment
# payload. `.env.local` holds a real admin key on a developer machine, and it
# would also override the dashboard's NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL at build time —
# quietly pinning production at http://localhost:8000.
.env
.env.*

# Regenerated by the build; uploading them only slows it down.
.next
node_modules
.vercel
